TI  - Coupled carbon and nitrogen cycling regulates the cnidarian-algal symbiosis
T2  - NATURE COMMUNICATIONS
LA  - English
KW  - REEF CORALS
KW  - LIGHT
KW  - SYMBIODINIUM
KW  - EVOLUTION
KW  - COASTAL
